First you need to use configure. Run `./configure --arches` to see the available arches.
You can then you `./configure --arch [ARCH]` to configure LineCore for your arch.

Then, run `make kernelconfig`.
Or optionally run `make kerneldefconfig` if you don't want to modify the config.

Finally you can `make`

